ll},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/864360916","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/2361#issuecomment-864360916","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/2361","id":864360916,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg2NDM2MDkxNg==","user":{"login":"jacobgardner","id":245622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTYyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner","html_url":"https://github.com/jacobgardner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-19T05:52:58Z","updated_at":"2021-06-19T05:53:34Z","body":"It looks like Duration's nanosecond precision can cause `Timer::percent()` to return 1.0 even when it's just barely not quite there yet. \r\n\r\n```rust\r\n// From bevy_core/src/time/timer.rs:220 - 222\r\n\r\n  self.times_finished = self.percent().floor() as u32;\r\n  // Duration does not have a modulo\r\n  self.set_elapsed(self.elapsed() - self.duration() * self.times_finished);\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo `times_finished` should be at 0 still instead of 1 (or whatever rising edge we're at), but because percent's precision was too low it got rounded up prematurely.  \r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/864360916/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jacobgardner","id":245622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTYyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner","html_url":"https://github.com/jacobgardner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/864362531","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/2361#issuecomment-864362531","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/2361","id":864362531,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg2NDM2MjUzMQ==","user":{"login":"jacobgardner","id":245622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTYyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner","html_url":"https://github.com/jacobgardner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-19T06:11:30Z","updated_at":"2021-06-19T06:11:30Z","body":"All the tests appear to pass when doing integer division directly, i.e.\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n        if self.finished() {\r\n            if self.repeating() {\r\n                self.times_finished = (self.elapsed().as_nanos() / self.duration.as_nanos()) as u32;\r\n                // Duration does not have a modulo\r\n                self.set_elapsed(self.elapsed() - self.duration() * self.times_finished);\r\n            } else {\r\n                self.times_finished = 1;\r\n                self.set_elapsed(self.duration());\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/864362531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jacobgardner","id":245622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTYyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner","html_url":"https://github.com/jacobgardner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jacobgardner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions